# Multiple Sclerosis Conversion Predictor
This is a Random Forest Classifier that predicts if Clinically Isolated Syndrome (CIS) will develop into Multiple Sclerosis (MS).
Dataset: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/desalegngeb/conversion-predictors-of-cis-to-multiple-sclerosis/data
Results: 98% test accuracy, 0.97 recall on instances of CIS -> MS conversion
Tutorial: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=777Qb0gHuJU